# Konfigurasi terpusat BisnisInsight — Fase 1

Bukan file yang di-load bawaan. Sumber kebenaran ada di masing-masing package:

- `apps/backend/.env.example`
- `apps/frontend/.env.example`

`.env` root hanya ringkasan. Nilai penting Fase 1:

## Backend (apps/backend/.env)

- `NODE_ENV=development`
- `PORT=3000`
- `DATABASE_URL="mysql://root@127.0.0.1:3306/bisnis_insight_analytics_db"`
- `JWT_SECRET="<minimal 32 karakter>"`
- `ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=15m`
- `REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL_DAYS=7`
- `CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:3001` (dev; produksi hanya origin frontend)

## Frontend (apps/frontend/.env.local)

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_ACCESS_COOKIE_NAME=bi_at`
